-- Site Reports registers: seed from TOOLS_R1.xlsx (sheet 'Sheet1 (2)') and Manpower.xlsx (Sheet1).
-- Generated by a script; re-running is safe (existing tool numbers / employee codes are skipped).
-- The roster workbook's Date Joined, Date of Birth and Contact columns hold placeholder values
-- (2000-01-01 / 1980-01-01 / 39393939 on every row) and are not loaded.

on conflict (tool_no) do nothing;

on conflict (emp_code) do nothing;
